<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac says SBC is one buyback broker.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac says SBC is one buyback broker.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp said on Wednesday it had appointed SBC Warburg as the second broker to conduct the bank's planned share buyback of 85 million shares.</p>
<p>Ord Minnett was named as the first broker when the buyback was announced by Westpac on November 4. Westpac said the latest appointment would broaden its access to the market.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
